WEBVTT

00:00:19.701 --> 00:00:22.746
We have confirmed
that 10 high-security prisoners...

00:00:22.954 --> 00:00:25.749
...in the early hours of yesterday evening
did escape.

00:00:25.957 --> 00:00:29.586
And of course, the Muggle prime minister
has been alerted to the danger.

00:00:29.753 --> 00:00:31.838
We strongly suspect...

00:00:32.672 --> 00:00:34.794
...that the breakout was engineered...

00:00:34.841 --> 00:00:39.054
...by a man with personal experience
in escaping from Azkaban...

00:00:39.221 --> 00:00:43.475
...notorious mass murderer Sirius Black...

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:47.943
...cousin of escapee Bellatrix Lestrange.

00:00:59.574 --> 00:01:01.438
Dumbledore warned Fudge
this could happen.

00:01:02.035 --> 00:01:04.455
He's gonna get us all killed
just because he can't face the truth.

00:01:05.372 --> 00:01:06.498
Harry.

00:01:07.749 --> 00:01:09.000
I, uh....

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:11.432
I wanted to apologize.

00:01:12.796 --> 00:01:15.767
Now even me mum says the Prophet's
version of things don't add up.

00:01:17.134 --> 00:01:21.946
So, what I'm really trying to say
is that I believe you.

00:01:30.021 --> 00:01:31.126
Neville?

00:01:44.161 --> 00:01:45.459
Fourteen years ago...

00:01:46.538 --> 00:01:49.840
...a Death Eater
named Bellatrix Lestrange...

00:01:50.917 --> 00:01:53.219
...used a Cruciatus Curse on my parents.

00:01:54.671 --> 00:01:57.555
She tortured them for information...

00:01:58.842 --> 00:02:00.022
...but they never gave in.

00:02:02.679 --> 00:02:04.142
I'm quite proud to be their son.

00:02:06.141 --> 00:02:08.851
But I'm not sure
I'm ready for everyone to know just yet.

00:02:15.942 --> 00:02:19.081
We're gonna make them proud, Neville.
That's a promise.

00:02:24.326 --> 00:02:28.038
Make it a powerful memory,
the happiest you can remember.

00:02:28.205 --> 00:02:30.795
Allow it to fill you up.
Keep trying, Seamus.

00:02:31.791 --> 00:02:33.210
George, your turn now.

00:02:34.586 --> 00:02:36.120
Expecto Patronum.

00:02:37.797 --> 00:02:41.218
A full-bodied Patronus
is the most difficult to produce...

00:02:41.384 --> 00:02:45.222
...but shield forms can also be equally
useful against a variety of opponents.

00:02:45.388 --> 00:02:46.640
Wow, that was really good.

00:02:47.349 --> 00:02:48.892
Fantastic, Ginny.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:53.104
Remember, your Patronus can only protect
you for as long as you stay focused.

00:02:53.271 --> 00:02:54.637
So focus, Luna.

00:02:59.277 --> 00:03:00.987
Think of the happiest thing you can.

00:03:01.154 --> 00:03:03.114
Expecto Patronum.

00:03:03.281 --> 00:03:06.159
- I'm trying.
- I know. It's good.

00:03:06.326 --> 00:03:09.329
This is really advanced stuff, guys.
You're doing so well.

00:03:11.331 --> 00:03:13.750
Expecto Patronum.

00:03:55.542 --> 00:03:57.378
I'll make short work of this.

00:03:59.337 --> 00:04:00.859
Bombarda Maxima.

00:04:19.733 --> 00:04:21.109
Get them.

00:04:21.526 --> 00:04:23.028
Been watching them for weeks.

00:04:23.194 --> 00:04:25.113
And see, "Dumbledore's Army"...

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:29.242
...proof of what I've been telling you
right from the beginning, Cornelius.

00:04:30.618 --> 00:04:32.662
All your fear-mongering
about You-Know-Who...

00:04:32.829 --> 00:04:34.372
...never fooled us for a minute.

00:04:34.539 --> 00:04:36.624
We saw your lies for what they were:

00:04:36.791 --> 00:04:40.027
A smokescreen for your bid
to seize control of the Ministry.

00:04:40.404 --> 00:04:41.506
Naturally.

00:04:41.693 --> 00:04:43.957
No, professor.
He had nothing to do with it. It was me.

00:04:44.536 --> 00:04:48.065
Most noble of you, Harry, to shield me,
but as has been pointed out...

00:04:48.731 --> 00:04:52.850
...the parchment clearly says
"Dumbledore's Army," not "Potter's."

00:04:53.516 --> 00:04:55.824
I instructed Harry
to form this organization.

00:04:56.311 --> 00:04:59.773
And I, and I alone,
am responsible for its activities.

00:04:59.939 --> 00:05:01.775
Dispatch an owl to the Daily Prophet.

00:05:01.941 --> 00:05:03.756
If we hurry,
we should still make the morning edition.

00:05:04.652 --> 00:05:08.449
Dawlish, Shacklebolt,
you will escort Dumbledore...

00:05:09.616 --> 00:05:11.034
...to Azkaban...

00:05:12.285 --> 00:05:16.873
...to await trial
for conspiracy and sedition.

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.533
Ah. I thought we might hit
this little snag.

00:05:21.753 --> 00:05:24.733
You seem to be laboring
under the delusion that I'm going to--

00:05:25.757 --> 00:05:26.785
What was the phrase?

00:05:27.342 --> 00:05:28.437
--come quietly.

00:05:29.094 --> 00:05:30.314
Well, I can tell you this:

00:05:31.262 --> 00:05:33.556
I have no intention of going to Azkaban.

00:05:33.605 --> 00:05:34.814
Enough of this.

00:05:35.475 --> 00:05:36.559
Take him.

00:05:47.404 --> 00:05:48.662
Whoa.

00:05:49.406 --> 00:05:52.695
Well, you may not like him, minister...

00:05:53.952 --> 00:05:55.279
...but you can't deny...

00:05:56.621 --> 00:05:58.424
...Dumbledore has got style.

00:06:23.106 --> 00:06:27.656
Boys and girls cannot be
within eight inches of each other.

00:06:28.153 --> 00:06:29.279
Those wishing to join

00:06:29.446 --> 00:06:31.573
the Inquisitorial Squad
for extra credit....

00:06:31.865 --> 00:06:36.151
Students will be submitted to questioning
about suspected illicit activities.

00:06:37.078 --> 00:06:41.374
Any student in noncompliance
will be expelled.

